# 2. SCREEN STRUCTURE

Build the leaderboard in the following exact vertical order:

1. Purple screen background and status bar.
2. Header containing a back arrow and centered “Leaderboard” title.
3. Weekly / All Time segmented control.
4. Orange performance-highlight card.
5. Small countdown timer pill.
6. Three-player podium section.
7. Floating white leaderboard list container.
8. Ranked player rows inside the white container, continuing vertically as needed.

All these sections belong to a SINGLE vertically composed mobile screen.

The podium and ranked list must feel visually connected. The leaderboard list container overlaps the bottom area of the podium section, creating a layered, floating-card effect.

Do not turn the podium into a separate page or put the player list on a completely separate screen.

